 outstanding RSUs and PSUs.</span></div><div style="height:36pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:right"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:93.506%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:4.294%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%">DMC GLOBAL INC.</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%"> </span><span style="color:#8e7630;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%">&#9679;</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%"> 2026 PROXY STATEMENT</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Poppins Medium',sans-serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%">71</span></div></td></tr></table></div></div></div><div id="i432f4154457c4071a4df14f0e3b0e460_1355"></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:84.96pt;width:100%"><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:25pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.881%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.184%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:90.616%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #8e7630;padding:2px 1pt;text-a